    "What changed in every version, from 1.0.0 to %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was sich in jeder Version geändert hat, von 1.0.0 bis %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What InjeKt plays next, and when.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was InjeKt als Nächstes spielt, und wann."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What played, and what stopped it. If the music stops by itself, share this with the developer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was lief und wodurch es gestoppt wurde. Wenn die Musik von selbst stoppt, schick das dem Entwickler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you've played, %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was du gespielt hast, %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When keys clash, filter out of the old track instead of blending.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passen die Tonarten nicht zusammen, wird der alte Titel weggefiltert statt überblendet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the queue runs out, music like what's been playing keeps coming: similar songs, artists like these and your own favourites. Its songs show under their own heading in Up next. Tapping the shuffle button twice turns it on too.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn die Warteliste zu Ende ist, kommt weiter Musik wie die, die gerade lief: ähnliche Titel, ähnliche Künstler und deine eigenen Favoriten. Diese Titel stehen unter einer eigenen Überschrift in „Als Nächstes“. Zweimal auf die Zufallstaste tippen schaltet Karousel ebenfalls ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which crate": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welche Kiste"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which shortcut": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welcher Kurzbefehl"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which station": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welche Station"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Widgets": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Widgets"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Widgets on Home": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Widgets auf der Startseite"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Widgets sit at the top of Home: drag to move one, tap the red button to take it off, tap its size to change it. On Home itself, hold a widget for the same choices.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Widgets stehen oben auf der Startseite: Zieh eines, um es zu verschieben, tippe auf den roten Knopf, um es zu entfernen, und auf seine Größe, um sie zu ändern. Auf der Startseite selbst bekommst du dieselbe Auswahl, wenn du ein Widget gedrückt hältst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wind Down": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runterkommen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wind down before the sleep timer": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vor dem Schlaftimer ausklingen lassen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With crossfade off, the next track starts the instant this one ends.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ohne Überblenden beginnt der nächste Titel genau in dem Moment, in dem dieser endet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worked out by adding up the play counts of each artist’s tracks.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Errechnet aus den Wiedergaben aller Titel eines Künstlers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "wrong type": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "falscher Typ"
